            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\r\n\r\nI think most of the features will be spread across 'mini.terminals' (like open terminal and run command/selection in terminal) and 'mini.quickfix'. Nevertheless, this is a useful and quite comprehensive set of features to use as reference, thanks!",
